  {
    "hotel_id": "5238310",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/one-way-guesthouse-busan/hotel/busan-kr.html",
    "name": "One Way Guesthouse Busan",
    "detail": "Out of the four hostels I stayed in Korea, this is the best one. Originally I was planning to stay in the Haeundae area, but since I had booked a super early train in the morning, then I decided that staying in front of the Busan Station would be a better idea. This place is LESS THAN FIVE MINUTES ❨Yes! ❩ walk from the front door of the Station. There are plenty of Korean restaurants ❨BBQ, fried chicken, cold noodles, Jeju❩ and cafes and convenience stores ❨GS25 and CU❩ dotting these few streets, still opening at 11pm. Not to mention there is a Chinatown opp the Stn. This hostel runs its own cafe. Looks quite pro, judging from the barista. The quality of room is very high and CLEAN ❨Yes, u read me right. I've encountered many dirty places in this country.❩ The rooms are operated by door passcode, very pro. I'll definitely stay here if I ever get to visit Busan again. Happy travels! ",
